  <RimMind.Settings.MaxConcurrent>Max Concurrent Requests</RimMind.Settings.MaxConcurrent>
  <RimMind.Settings.MaxConcurrent.Desc>Maximum number of simultaneous AI requests. Higher values improve responsiveness but increase API costs.</RimMind.Settings.MaxConcurrent.Desc>
  <RimMind.Settings.MaxRetry>Max Retry Count</RimMind.Settings.MaxRetry>
  <RimMind.Settings.MaxRetry.Desc>Maximum number of retries after a request failure. Set to 0 to disable retries.</RimMind.Settings.MaxRetry.Desc>
  <RimMind.Settings.RequestTimeout>Request Timeout (seconds)</RimMind.Settings.RequestTimeout>
  <RimMind.Settings.RequestTimeout.Desc>Maximum time to wait for an AI response before timing out. Increase for slow models or networks.</RimMind.Settings.RequestTimeout.Desc>
  <RimMind.Settings.RequestExpireTicks>Request Expiry (ticks)</RimMind.Settings.RequestExpireTicks>
  <RimMind.Settings.RequestExpireTicks.Desc>Requests older than this tick count are automatically removed from the queue. Prevents stale requests from accumulating. Range: 6000-120000.</RimMind.Settings.RequestExpireTicks.Desc>
  <RimMind.Settings.BehaviorHistoryMax>Behavior History Limit</RimMind.Settings.BehaviorHistoryMax>
  <RimMind.Settings.BehaviorHistoryMax.Desc>Maximum number of behavior history records retained per agent. Higher values provide more context but increase token usage. Range: 10-500.</RimMind.Settings.BehaviorHistoryMax.Desc>
