  <RimMind.Settings.DefaultModCooldown.Desc>Default cooldown in ticks between consecutive requests for the same mod. Prevents API rate limiting. Individual mods may override this. Range: 600-36000.</RimMind.Settings.DefaultModCooldown.Desc>
